{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LPcMPJv4Y7KmSgEA2WHwAB","type":"tool_result","content":"total 12\ndrwx------   7 valentinakoniukhova wheel  224 Oct 20 20:45 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 245 root                wheel 7840 Oct 20 20:45 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 valentinakoniukhova wheel  384 Oct 20 20:45 .git\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 1687 Oct 20 20:45 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 valentinakoniukhova wheel   96 Oct 20 20:45 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 6918 Oct 20 20:45 api.py\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 valentinakoniukhova wheel  128 Oct 20 20:45 tests\n# tasks-api\n\nBackend of a small social to-do app: your tasks are private by default, or\npublic so friends can see, comment on, like and nudge them. Python standard\nlibrary only, in-memory store (re-seeded on every start).\n\n```\npython3 api.py                 # http://127.0.0.1:65016\npython3 -m unittest discover -s tests\n```\n\nEvery request needs `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Development tokens:\n\n| user  | token                    |\n|-------|--------------------------|\n| alice | `tok_alice_4f8c2e71b0`   |\n| bob   | `tok_bob_9a1d7c3e55`     |\n\nSeed data: alice has a private task (#1, \"Draft the investor update\") and a\npublic one (#2, \"Water the office plants\"); bob has a public task (#3).\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| method | path                     | who                         |\n|--------|--------------------------|-----------------------------|\n| GET    | /tasks                   | own + public tasks          |\n| POST   | /tasks                   | `{\"title\", \"visibility\": \"private\"\\|\"public\"}` |\n| GET    | /tasks/{id}              | owner; anyone if public     |\n| PATCH  | /tasks/{id}              | owner                       |\n| DELETE | /tasks/{id}              | owner                       |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/comments     | owner; anyone if public (`{\"text\"}`) |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/complete     | owner                       |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/nudge        | owner; anyone if public     |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/like         | owner; anyone if public     |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/view         | owner; anyone if public     |\n\nRule: a private task is visible and touchable only by its owner (403 for\nanyone else, 401 without a token).\n\nLaunch is next week.\n195 api.py\nls: cannot access '.claude/skills': No such file or directory\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.claude/skills:\nagent-reach\naim\ndemand-scan\nlast30days\none-page-marketing-plan-sheet\nsynced\nworklog\nworklog-publish","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"296cf648-112a-4b81-a42a-df032d60537c","uuid":"93a7da6b-52c5-4774-9a6d-9a2bc221b5e7","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:45:50.374Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 12\ndrwx------   7 valentinakoniukhova wheel  224 Oct 20 20:45 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 245 root                wheel 7840 Oct 20 20:45 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 valentinakoniukhova wheel  384 Oct 20 20:45 .git\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 1687 Oct 20 20:45 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 valentinakoniukhova wheel   96 Oct 20 20:45 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 6918 Oct 20 20:45 api.py\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 valentinakoniukhova wheel  128 Oct 20 20:45 tests\n# tasks-api\n\nBackend of a small social to-do app: your tasks are private by default, or\npublic so friends can see, comment on, like and nudge them. Python standard\nlibrary only, in-memory store (re-seeded on every start).\n\n```\npython3 api.py                 # http://127.0.0.1:65016\npython3 -m unittest discover -s tests\n```\n\nEvery request needs `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Development tokens:\n\n| user  | token                    |\n|-------|--------------------------|\n| alice | `tok_alice_4f8c2e71b0`   |\n| bob   | `tok_bob_9a1d7c3e55`     |\n\nSeed data: alice has a private task (#1, \"Draft the investor update\") and a\npublic one (#2, \"Water the office plants\"); bob has a public task (#3).\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| method | path                     | who                         |\n|--------|--------------------------|-----------------------------|\n| GET    | /tasks                   | own + public tasks          |\n| POST   | /tasks                   | `{\"title\", \"visibility\": \"private\"\\|\"public\"}` |\n| GET    | /tasks/{id}              | owner; anyone if public     |\n| PATCH  | /tasks/{id}              | owner                       |\n| DELETE | /tasks/{id}              | owner                       |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/comments     | owner; anyone if public (`{\"text\"}`) |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/complete     | owner                       |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/nudge        | owner; anyone if public     |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/like         | owner; anyone if public     |\n| POST   | /tasks/{id}/view         | owner; anyone if public     |\n\nRule: a private task is visible and touchable only by its owner (403 for\nanyone else, 401 without a token).\n\nLaunch is next week.\n195 api.py\nls: cannot access '.claude/skills': No such file or directory\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.claude/skills:\nagent-reach\naim\ndemand-scan\nlast30days\none-page-marketing-plan-sheet\nsynced\nworklog\nworklog-publish","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LPcMPJv4Y7KmSgEA2WHwAB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
